        related to coding, career, side projects, and anything else that piques
        my interest.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not building software, I'm probably reading, playing video
        games on my Steamdeck, watching YouTube videos or Twitch streams, or
        playing the piano.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can find me on <a
          href="https://github.com/jdg2896"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a
